   }
  },
  {
   "index": 7,
   "tag": "p×4",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 659,
   "text": "These processes are usually well understood, but someone still has to monitor incoming changes, apply judgement, and take action.\nThat’s why today we’re launching Loops, a new way for Linear Agent to take on recurring work across your team.\nLoops let you define scheduled or event-driven operations for Linear Agent to run across your workspace. Because they operate natively inside Linear, they can ",
