   }
  },
  {
   "index": 16,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 246,
   "text": "Keep plans and documents current\nAt the end of each day, a Loop can review active projects and initiatives against a central release plan. When it finds that timing or scope has changed, it can update the document and leave a note explaining why.",
